{"_v":1,"id":"the-farnsworth-invention-2007","cs":65,"rc":6,"bd":{"positive":2,"mixed":3,"negative":1},"rv":[{"cn":"Linda Winer","o":"Newsday","s":80,"b":"Positive","t":1,"u":"https://www.newspapers.com/image/714794657/","d":"2007-12-04","q":"That is, it was less clear until today."},{"cn":"Charles Isherwood","o":"Variety","s":65,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://variety.com/2007/music/reviews/johnette-napolitano-1200558354/","d":"2007-12-03","q":"Aaron Sorkin's Broadway debut as a playwright is a thoughtful, well-crafted drama about the invention of television that unfortunately lacks the theatrical spark to fully ignite."},{"cn":"Terry Teachout","o":"The Wall Street Journal","s":63,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.wsj.com/articles/SB119658825043094127","d":"2007-12-04","q":"Aaron Sorkin's new play about the invention of television is a slick piece of work that manages to be simultaneously engrossing and irritating."},{"cn":"Ben Brantley","o":"The New York Times","s":62,"b":"Mixed","t":1,"u":"https://www.nytimes.com/2007/12/04/theater/reviews/04farn.html","d":"2007-12-04","q":"Whether these combined talents make for compelling theater as well as a peppy educational experience is another matter."},{"cn":"Joe Dziemianowicz","o":"New York Daily News","s":45,"b":"Negative","t":2,"u":"https://www.newspapers.com/image/411138289/","d":"2007-12-04","q":"But a play about the invention of television that fails to blaze in living color is another."},{"cn":"Eric March","o":"Theater Life","s":78,"b":"Positive","t":3,"u":"https://theaterlife.com/the-farnsworth-invention/","d":"2007-12-13","q":"As drama the evening lacks tension, but Des McAnuff’s beautifully acted stylish production moves along with such razor sharp precision that the unfolding events make for a compelling, richly satisfying evening nonetheless."}],"au":{"score":75,"designation":"Shrugging","sources":{"mz":{"s":75,"c":2,"sr":3.8}}},"ta":"239 W 45th St, New York, NY 10036","pd":"2007-10-15","ca":[{"n":"Hank Azaria","r":"David Sarnoff"},{"n":"Jimmi Simpson","r":"Philo T. Farnsworth"},{"n":"Nadia Bowers","r":"Lizette Sarnoff"},{"n":"Kyle Fabel","r":"Pem's Father"},{"n":"Maurice Godin","r":"Atkins"},{"n":"Aaron Krohn","r":"Wilkins"},{"n":"Christian McCarthy Johansen","r":"Young Philo T. Farnsowrth"},{"n":"Bruce McKenzie","r":"George Everson"},{"n":"Malcolm Morano","r":"Young David Sarnoff"},{"n":"Spencer Moses","r":"Stan Willis"},{"n":"Michael Mulheren","r":"Leslie Gorrell"},{"n":"Jim Ortlieb","r":"Justin Tolman"},{"n":"Michael Pemberton","r":"Sarnoff's Father"},{"n":"Katharine Powell","r":"Betty"},{"n":"Steve Rosen","r":"Harlan Honn"},{"n":"James Sutorius","r":"Russian Officer"},{"n":"Margot White","r":"Sarnoff's Mother"},{"n":"Alexandra Wilson","r":"Pem Farnsworth"},{"n":"William Youmans","r":"Wachtel"}]}